<title>UK: Yamaichi Europe adds syndicate, fixed income staff.</title>
<headline>Yamaichi Europe adds syndicate, fixed income staff.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamaichi International (Europe) Ltd said on Wednesday it had appointed nine new people to its syndicate and fixed income division.</p>
<p>Appointments include Andy Lothian who joins as head of debt syndication and Naresh Sonpar who joins the financial engineering group. Sonpar will help develop structured products for European investors. Both were previously at Paribas.</p>
<p>Four new salesmen join fixed income sales, reporting to Andrew McCaffery, head of international interest rate sales.</p>
<p>Other appointments are to Yamaichi's credit trading group.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
